            "title": "Concept",
            "paragraphs": [
              "Context construction selects what the next model call sees. Keep authoritative instructions, current goal, tool contracts, relevant evidence and recent outcomes. A summary can shorten older material but may omit caveats or invent a connection. Store source references and distinguish facts from hypotheses. Do not turn a summary of retrieved content into a privileged instruction just because it is shorter."
            ]
