            "example": "1. propose: search_lessons({\"query\": \"joins\"})\n2. validate arguments and policy\n3. execute approved local search\n4. observe: SQL-07, title, excerpt\n5. propose: finish(answer, citations=[\"SQL-07\"])\n6. validate output and evidence IDs\n7. stop with status=completed"
