            "example": "import numpy as np\n\nhours = np.array([23.9, 24.0, 24.1])\nprint(hours > 24)\n\nminutes = hours * 60\nprint(minutes > 24 * 60)\n\n# Output:\n# [False False  True]\n# [False False  True]"
