              "Run the evaluation with three to five reviewers who each walk through realistic tasks alone, noting every problem with the heuristic it breaks, where it occurs and what they observed. Merge the lists afterwards; independent reviewers find different problems. Rate severity from 0 (not a problem) to 4 (usability catastrophe) by frequency, impact and persistence, and fix the high ratings first."
